    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Attention*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game only support Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014About the Story\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily(\u8389\u9732\u62c9Lily)'s birthday is about to come, as one of her best friends, Momoka(\u732b\u732b\u5377Momoka) wants to prepare an unforgettable birthday party for Lily. But things doesn't always go as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where it all went wrong? Lily wants to find the answers to the question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Game Type\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AVG </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Main Charactors\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/1e00ce8b70f73301ced99bc196b33312.avif?t=1741665411\" width=500 height=500 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/1ac26dec01df9a2c9aa6a87de99ede80.avif?t=1741665411\" width=500 height=500 /></span>Other appearing menbers of Mo-o Project\uff1aKisu\uff08\u5343\u9165kisu\uff09\u3001MIF\uff08\u5f25\u996dMIF\uff09\u3001Sinon\uff08\u5e0c\u8bfa_Sinon\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014About Gameplay\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controling Lily to explore the office building of Mo-o Project(none related to any real architecture) and find what happened to Momoka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/8aa0742bfac1ae05a49cd3ea41ae31a6.avif?t=1741665411\" width=320 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with other members of Mo-o Project to obtain key items and finish Lily's special magic rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/66669099e2254cc00dc2f10579652666.avif?t=1741665411\" width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, during this period, there may be some strange things waiting\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/7a3ffffb4d04a7981246ee7feb893bed.avif?t=1741665411\" width=478 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Others\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a derivative work of Mo-o Project(a virtual idol project) and Lily(\u8389\u9732\u62c9Lily).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is made with RPG Maker MV.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Attention*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game only support Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014About the Story\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily(\u8389\u9732\u62c9Lily)'s birthday is about to come, as one of her best friends, Momoka(\u732b\u732b\u5377Momoka) wants to prepare an unforgettable birthday party for Lily. But things doesn't always go as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where it all went wrong? Lily wants to find the answers to the question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Game Type\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AVG </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Main Charactors\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/1e00ce8b70f73301ced99bc196b33312.avif?t=1741665411\" width=500 height=500 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/1ac26dec01df9a2c9aa6a87de99ede80.avif?t=1741665411\" width=500 height=500 /></span>Other appearing menbers of Mo-o Project\uff1aKisu\uff08\u5343\u9165kisu\uff09\u3001MIF\uff08\u5f25\u996dMIF\uff09\u3001Sinon\uff08\u5e0c\u8bfa_Sinon\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014About Gameplay\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controling Lily to explore the office building of Mo-o Project(none related to any real architecture) and find what happened to Momoka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/8aa0742bfac1ae05a49cd3ea41ae31a6.avif?t=1741665411\" width=320 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with other members of Mo-o Project to obtain key items and finish Lily's special magic rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/66669099e2254cc00dc2f10579652666.avif?t=1741665411\" width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, during this period, there may be some strange things waiting\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875180/extras/7a3ffffb4d04a7981246ee7feb893bed.avif?t=1741665411\" width=478 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Others\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a derivative work of Mo-o Project(a virtual idol project) and Lily(\u8389\u9732\u62c9Lily).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is made with RPG Maker MV.</p>",
